# Ozelu storefront

Next.js customer site (`:3000`). API/admin: sibling `ozelu-backend-v6n`.

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/CURSOR-INDEX.md`. Routes/UI: `docs/storefront-routes-and-ui.md`. Shared architecture: sibling `docs/PROJECT-OVERVIEW.md`.

- Guest checkout via `session_id`. Do not add customer auth unless asked.
- Pay: createOrder then `/api/stripe/pay`. Form retry = new order / possible double charge.
- Keep `SearchableSelect` `menuPortalTarget` optional.
- Do not change shared CSS/components without checking other service pages.
- Verify in the browser on `localhost:3000`.
